    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Color\r\n\r\nNotice that there is a new section of our webpage called `<style>`. This defines the rules for how the webpage should look.\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand the `color` and `background-color` rules and add new styles to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain the rules for these new CSS elements.\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to update the punk rock section of this webpage.\r\n    - Use specific language, like `background-color` or `color`, to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've styled the punk rock section: press the Continue button!",
